        "question": "整体思想 若$m$是方程$x^2-2x-1=0$的根，则$m^2+\\dfrac{1}{m^2}$的值为 __________。",
        "option": [],
        "answer": "6",
        "analysis": "$\\because m$ 是方程 $x^2-2x-1=0$ 的根, $\\therefore m^2-2m-1=0$,且 $m \\neq 0$, $\\therefore m-2-\\dfrac{1}{m}=0$,即 $m-\\dfrac{1}{m}=2$. 两边分别平方,得 $\\left(m-\\dfrac{1}{m}\\right)^2=4$,即 $m^2-2+\\dfrac{1}{m^2}=4$, $\\therefore m^2+\\dfrac{1}{m^2}=6$.<br>",
        "tishi": "tiankong",
        "comment": "",
        "step": ""
      },
