        "tihao": "",
        "question": "若$x_0$是方程$ax^2+2x+c=0(a \\neq 0)$的一个根，设$M=1-ac$，$N=(ax_0+1)^2$，试比较$M$与$N$的大小。",
        "option": [],
        "answer": "$\\because x_0$ 是方程 $ax^2+2x+c=0(a\\neq0)$ 的一个根，$\\therefore ax_0^2+2x_0+c=0$，即 $ax_0^2=-2x_0-c$，$\\therefore N=(ax_0+1)^2=a^2x_0^2+2ax_0+1=a(-2x_0-c)+2ax_0+1=1-ac$。$\\because M=1-ac$，$\\therefore M=N$",
        "analysis": "",
        "tishi": "wenda",
        "comment": "",
        "step": ""
      },
